 Categories: community\, free\nSource: funcheap/san-francisco\n\nYoung Prof
 essionals in Transportation hosts a Transit Month trivia night and social 
 mixer aboard the San Francisco Bay Ferry. Meet at Gate G at the SF Ferry T
 erminal for the ride to Jack London Square in Oakland and return to San Fr
 ancisco. Attendees may join either leg of the trip\, and the first 25 RSVP
 s receive vouchers for the ride to Oakland. Original Event Description: Ha
 ppy Transit Month! ⛴️🚢🛶🚊🚉🚂 In collaboration with the Sa
 n Francisco Bay Ferry\, we are hosting a trivia night and social mixer on 
 board the Ferry from the San Francisco Ferry Terminal to Jack London Squar
 e in Oakland. We will plan to meet at 6:15 pm to catch the ferry to Oaklan
 d\, and will stay on the ferry to return to San Francisco by 7:30 pm. RSVP
  at the link in bio! First 25 RSVPs get vouchers covering the ride to Oakl
 and. If you can’t stay with us the whole time\, you are welcome to join 
 during either leg of the trip. 🗓️ WHEN: Friday September 25\, 2026\, 
 6:15 pm – 7:30 pm ⛴️ Meet at: SF Ferry Terminal Gate G Hope to see y
 ou all there! RSVP here or at the link in bio: https://yptransportation.ap
 p.neoncrm.com/nx/portal/neonevents/events?path=%2Fportal%2Fevents%2F58468
