 ths\, archery\, volleyball\, games\, arts and crafts\, face painting\, and
  KidsZone activities. Free refreshments include popcorn\, lemonade\, pizza
 \, gelato\, cupcakes\, and more. Original Event Description: _EVERYBODY IS
  WELCOME AT UPPER NOE NEIGHBORFEST featuring the ADRIAN WEST BAND So\, com
 e celebrate Good Neighbor Week with us at Upper Noe Rec Center on Saturday
 \, September 26 from 11 to 2. The Adrian West Band\, a big hit at UN Block
  Party 2024\, return to provide upbeat tunes to delight everyone. MoBu Dan
 ce Studio performs at 11:45. Esteemed civic leaders will be there too. Rec
  & Park will have special activities like safe & fun archery\, volleyball 
