 amming. Original Event Description: _The Randall Museum (199 Museum Way) w
 ill celebrate its 75th anniversary on the slopes of Corona Heights Park on
  Sunday\, September 27\, from 1 to 5 p.m. This free\, family-friendly cele
 bration will feature the opening of a new history exhibit\, live music\, c
 rafts\, climbing\, skateboarding\, archery and more. For decades\, the mus
 eum has offered hands-on art\, science and nature programming rooted in th
 e area’s distinctive hillside ecology. Ahead of the milestone\, San Fran
 ciscans are invited to share their stories and memories of how the Randall
  has brought joy\, inspiration\, learning and community to their lives. su
 n 27 sep Randall Museum 75th Anniversary Celebration 1:00 pm – 5:00 pm E
