SUMMARY:[Free] Lunada’s “New Moon Fest” 2026: 25th Anniversary Lit +
  Poetry Night (Mission)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T190000
DTSTAMP:20260921T174926Z
UID:funcheap-20261010-lunadasnewmoonfest202625
CATEGORIES:free
DESCRIPTION:https://sf.funcheap.com/lunadas-moon-fest-2026-25th-anniversar
 y-lit-poetry-night-mission/\nLocation: san francisco\nPrice: Free\nCategor
 ies: free\nSource: funcheap/san-francisco\n\nGalería de la Raza’s Lunad
 a New Moon Fest marks the 25th anniversary of Lunada Literary Lounge and s
 erves as the final stop of Litquake’s ¡Poetry on la Veinti Cuatro! craw
 l. The free event features poetry and spoken-word performances\, musica\, 
 an open mic\, a DJ and local vendors at Studio 24 in the Mission. Original
  Event Description: _🌌 🌒 Celebrate 25 years of literary magic under 
 the moon at Lunada New Moon Fest! Mark your calendars for our final conjur
 ing of the year happening on Saturday\, October 10th. Lunada’s last cele
 bration of the year will also be the final stop of ¡Poetry on la Veinti C
 uatro! for this year’s Litquake. Curated by Josiah Luis Alderete ¡Poetr
 y on la Veinti Cuatro! is a 24th Street poetry crawl celebrating three Mis
 sion reading series that have been integral in shaping this neighborhood
 ’s deep literary history: Poets in the Window at Medicine for Nightmares
 \, Pan Dulce Poets at La Reyna Bakery\, and La Lunada at Galería de la Ra
 za. Join us to cap off the day with even more performances curated by Norm
 an Zelaya\, a DJ\, and vendors. We hope to see you there! ⏰ Saturday\, O
 ctober 10\, 5 PM 📍Galería de la Raza Studio 24 2779 Folsom St. Ste. A 
 San Francisco\, CA 94110 #g
LOCATION:san francisco
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/lunadas-moon-fest-2026-25th-anniversary-lit-po
 etry-night-mission/
